  "details": "This one isn't hard to explain. I would like all the opinions available in the quick menu's options to also be in the main menu's options. It's both become harder to find the options I need and to explain where a new option is to a friend. I get having the choose between the new menus but as is it's rather confusing.\nPlus some of the stuff in the action menu could be in the other setting's menus. Unless it's a debug feature or another option that needs accessed on-the-fly I'd say it should stay out of the action menu",
